    "id": "76944",
    "original": "Ｋさんの内緒にしていただくとの約束のもとに前回「左右」後日談なる駄文をお送りしましたが、今回はその後日談です。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "326776",
        "text": "Last time I sent out my humble work, the afterword to \"left-right\", written on the promise that you'd keep it secret from him, this time it's the afterword to that afterword."
